                        <li><strong>Achievable:</strong> Start with what they can accomplish in 3-6 months</li>
                        <li><strong>Relevant:</strong> Connect to their actual interests and life situation</li>
                        <li><strong>Time-bound:</strong> "By the end of this school year" or "in 6 months"</li>
